[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m Substituting \(z = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)} = \frac{96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4} = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m Adding these two expressions together, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta) = 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + i(300\sin\theta + 468\cos\theta + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta) = 324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + i(336\cos\theta + 276\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=169544)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\). To maximize this, we need to maximize \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\). The maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\), so the maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 468^2}\).
